    <h3 itemprop="name">Can I read Kindle or Kobo books on the Hisense A10?</h3>
    <div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
      <div itemprop="text">
        <p>Yes, through their apps. Amazon's Kindle app and Kobo's app can be sideloaded onto the A10, and books you buy from those stores open inside them with DRM intact. For DRM-free EPUB files, any sideloaded reader app will open them directly.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
    <h3 itemprop="name">How do I put EPUB files on the Hisense A10?</h3>
