      <div itemprop="text">
        <p>Copy EPUB files to the phone over USB-C, or transfer them through cloud storage such as Dropbox or Google Drive. Android treats EPUB as an openable file type, so you can tap a file and choose your reading app. Organizing your library in Calibre before transferring keeps titles, covers, and series data clean.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
